# STIG ID: V-258138 (LOW)

META
    esp_id `r9-rhel-09-651030-aide-xattrs-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `rocky9`
    criticality `medium`

    title `STIG RHEL-09-651030: RHEL 9 must be configured so that the file integrity tool verifies Access Contro`
    description `RHEL 9 must be configured so that the file integrity tool verifies Access Control Lists (ACLs).`
    author `example-security`
    tags `rhel9,stig,disa-stig`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:RHEL-09-651030,NIST-800-53:CM-6`
    control_objective `CM-6`

